> Using Optionals

```catala-metadata
#[test]
#[testcase.testui]
#[testcase.test_description = ""]
#[testcase.test_title = "Bonus absent"]
declaration scope Grant_absent:
  output grant scope Optionals.Grant
  
```

```catala
scope Grant_absent:
  definition grant.base equals $1000.00
  definition grant.bonus equals Absent
  assertion (grant.total = $1000.00)
```

```catala-metadata
#[test]
